### Connexion dentiste
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mail": "tbilarsiah@gmail.com",
  "mot_de_passe": "Test1234"
}

### Ajouter ou changer ma photo
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/dentistes/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenDentiste}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=FormBoundary

--FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test.jpg
--FormBoundary--

### Supprimer ma photo
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/dentistes/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenDentiste}}

### Mon profil
GET http://localhost:5000/api/dentistes/mon-profil
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenDentiste}}

### Annuaire
GET http://localhost:5000/api/dentistes

### Modifier mon mot de passe
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/dentistes/compte
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenDentiste}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mot_de_passe_actuel": "Test1234",
  "nouveau_mot_de_passe": "Nouveau1234"
}

### Modifier mon email (mauvais mot de passe actuel, doit donner 401)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/dentistes/compte
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenDentiste}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mot_de_passe_actuel": "Faux12345",
  "nouveau_mail": "autre@gmail.com"
}